    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/5ae47d389420c942324428d193a4c2eb.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=180 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/c9ba250a4a8896bf97f14e76fc5cc737.poster.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/c9ba250a4a8896bf97f14e76fc5cc737.webm?t=1753953136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/c9ba250a4a8896bf97f14e76fc5cc737.mp4?t=1753953136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of being an idol manager?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come to embark on that journey! After a car accident, you suddenly find yourself isekai\u2019d in the universe of a popular video game that you were playing. Here, you have to create your very own talent agency and find success in the exciting music industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/d2749396726f5f2d7a1d4e121da8d001.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This epic isekai idol business simulator features spectacular music and a builder-style gameplay. Build your agency, guide the babes towards celebrity, complete quests and unlock exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/b0758b82f56136ee618dd96f877f07e5.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/024ac54faf849939118cea26de5d1660.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=288 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/e206dea404058a56a1349761338acaef.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=288 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/1d0f0daeb4319f0e80d248d6151be866.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/bfd19296c8e82d0519192144b4a8e613.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the girls and make sure these sexy aspiring stars get everything they need on the path to popularity. The trainees are super talented and eager to become real idols, but they need you for that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/9a49b247e938ac3e912e0e09e6a13afc.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/01c145533843a1a82b794e1e6087b8b5.poster.avif?t=1753953136\" width=614 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589670/extras/01c145533843a1a82b794e1e6087b